[1084.552304, "o", "\u001b[7m# Phase 1 reflection — Student\u001b[27m\r\n\r\u001b[7m_Michael What did I do?                                                                                                 \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7m#I assist in the research on the threat model and how it will help us to draft the popya policy.                        \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7m(                                                                                                                       \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7m#I assist in the research of the threat model and the popya                                                             \u001b[27m \r\n"]
[1084.552699, "o", "\r\u001b[7mWhat did I find hard?                                                                                                   \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7m#I found navigating the WSL termenal a bit difficult. It felt very repetitive to retype commands all the time. I also st\u001b[27m\u001b[7mr\u001b[27m\u001b[7mugggled a bit to get reputable information regarding the popya policies. I found that there is so much information on t\u001b[27m\u001b[7mh\u001b[27m\u001b[7me popya act that we have to narrow it down to the scope of this project and bind it directy to Nomvula.                \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7mWhat would I do differently?                                                                                            \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7m#I will from now on modify my bootrc file so that I can have shorter easier commands for repetitive tasks such as recori\u001b[27m\u001b[7md\u001b[27m\u001b[7mings and pusing and pulling from GIT.                                                                                  \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7mWhat do I understand now that I did not before?_                                                                        \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7mI understand the lynex envorment a bit better now that I am activly using and utilising it for the project. navigatin be\u001b[27m\u001b[7mc\u001b[27m\u001b[7mame a bit easier. I am still developiing and adjusting. I am also considedring the implications it can bring for me in \u001b[27m\u001b[7mt\u001b[27m\u001b[7mhe future if I keep using and modifying the bootrc file. I have to find alternate selutions to stremline my workflow bu\u001b[27m\u001b[7mt\u001b[27m\u001b[7m also I have to keep in mind so that I can build my skill serounding the lynex enviroinment.                           \u001b[27m \r\n\r\u001b[7mmichael@LTMICHAEL:~/alp-env/nomvula_agri_finance/reflections/Michael$                     \u001b[27m"]
[1085.349124, "o", "\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\u001b[A\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b# Phase 1 reflection — Student\r\n\r_Michael What did I do?                                                                                                  \r\n\r#I assist in the research on the threat model and how it will help us to draft the popya policy.                         \r\n\r(                                                                                                                        \r\n\r#I assist in the research of the threat model and the popya                                                              \r\n"]
[1085.349464, "o", "\rWhat did I find hard?                                                                                                    \r\n\r#I found navigating the WSL termenal a bit difficult. It felt very repetitive to retype commands all the time. I also strugggled a bit to get reputable information regarding the popya policies. I found that there is so much information on the popya act that we have to narrow it down to the scope of this project and bind it directy to Nomvula.                 \r\n\rWhat would I do differently?                                                                                             \r\n\r#I will from now on modify my bootrc file so that I can have shorter easier commands for repetitive tasks such as recoridings and pusing and pulling from GIT.                                                                                   \r\n\rWhat do I understand now that I did not before?_                                                                         \r\n\rI understand the lynex envorment a bit better now that I am activly using and utilising it for the project. navigatin became a bit easier. I am still developiing and adjusting. I am also considedring the implications it can bring for me in the future if I keep using and modifying the bootrc file. I have to find alternate selutions to stremline my workflow but also I have to keep in mind so that I can build my skill serounding the lynex enviroinment.                            \r\n\rmichael@LTMICHAEL:~/alp-env/nomvula_agri_finance/reflections/Michael$                     \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
