[1176.898732, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Phase 1 reflection — Student \r\u001b[3d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m_Michael What did I do?\r\u001b[5d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m#I assist in the research on the threat model and how it will help us to draft the popya policy. \r\u001b[6d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(\u001b[8d\b\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m#I assist in the research of the threat model and the popya  \r\u001b[9d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat did I find hard?\r\u001b[11d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m#I found navigating the WSL termenal a bit difficult. It felt very repetitive to retype commands all the time. I also s\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[12;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat would I do differently?\r\u001b[13d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m#I will from now on modify my bootrc file so that I can have shorter easier commands for repetitive tasks such as recor\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[15;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat do I understand now that I did not before?_\r\u001b[16dI understand the lynex envorment a bit better now that I am activly using and utilising it for the project. navigatin b\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[2;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
