[1327.802853, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[1327.803205, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\rI understand the lynex envorment a bit better now that I am activly using and utilising it for the project. navigatin b\u001b[15;49H"]
[1331.670736, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m<\u001b(B\u001b[mring for me in the future if I keep using and modifying the bootrc file. I have to find alternate selutions to stremli\u001b[16;58H"]
[1332.04619, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\rI understand the lynex envorment a bit better now that I am activly using and utilising it for the project. navigatin b\r\u001b[17d"]
[1332.540454, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m<\u001b(B\u001b[mhe cloud. our thread model will expand on this research.\u001b[K"]
[1333.348795, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\rI have a deeper understanding of the popya acts and policies. During my threat intelegants reseach I found that there a\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[19;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[1333.912899, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[1741.660362, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[1742.522477, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[1742.552213, "o", "\u001b[2;28r\u001b[28;1H\u001b[4S\u001b[1;30r\u001b[15;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Phase 1 reflection — Michael\r\u001b[17d### What did I do?\r\u001b[18d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mI assisted in the research of the threat model and how it will help us to draft the POPIA policy. Our threat model will\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[20;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m### What did I find hard?\r\u001b[21d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mI found navigating the WSL terminal a bit difficult. It felt very repetitive to retype commands all the time. I also st\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[23;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m### What would I do differently?\r\u001b[24d"]
[1742.552368, "o", "\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mI will from now on modify my \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`.bashrc`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m file so that I can have shorter, easier commands for repetitive tasks such as re\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[26;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m### What do I understand now that I did not before?\r\u001b[27d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m<\u001b(B\u001b[mnvironment. I have a deeper understanding of the POPIA acts and policies during my threat intelligence research."]
[1742.552574, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[1747.684325, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
